{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265iEn3sMVgc1794780517.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股偏東氣流正逐漸影響廣東東部沿岸。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲，早晚有一兩陣微雨。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約26度。吹微風，漸轉吹和緩偏東風，稍後離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日短暫時間有陽光。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本週後期早晚天氣清涼。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T23:09:14.905433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T22:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T23:54:02.592008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T23:02:18.205676+00:00","content_hash":"ca9864e8b87ac8de546ec905067c687b1595939832451a039429295199c87b8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}